{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_retraction_audit_tsv", "label": "RETRACTION-AUDIT.tsv \u2014 is a withdrawn figure still standing?", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/RETRACTION-AUDIT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "391 rows in two passes over the 212 unbanked corrections, asking for each whether the superseded value or claim still stands in a published volume."}, {"id": "docs_retraction_audit_two_passes", "label": "Two passes, and neither alone is enough", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/RETRACTION-AUDIT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The numeric pass fingerprints distinctive numbers against the nine live volumes; the 88 corrections carrying no such number become the claim pass, adjudicated on the claim itself."}, {"id": "docs_retraction_audit_live_superseded", "label": "LIVE-SUPERSEDED \u2014 25 withdrawn values or claims asserted as current", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/RETRACTION-AUDIT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every one was re-checked directly against the volumes rather than taken from the adjudicator, because such a verdict is a claim about a published volume."}, {"id": "docs_retraction_audit_2475", "label": "The 2,475 case needs no interpretation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/RETRACTION-AUDIT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three occurrences in one file: two assert the figure and the third withdraws it. A self-contradiction inside one published volume, demonstrable from a single file."}, {"id": "docs_retraction_audit_marker_convention", "label": "The corpus marks a withdrawn entry when it knows", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/RETRACTION-AUDIT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "That convention is what makes the 25 legible; eleven flagged entries carry no marker in a Register that marks elsewhere, which is corroboration and not proof, and register 1395's WARNING is the useful counter-example."}, {"id": "docs_retraction_audit_correction_superseded", "label": "An unbanked correction can itself be stale", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/RETRACTION-AUDIT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One row, and it is a warning about the whole exercise: a row in PROSE-ONLY.tsv is a candidate for R3, never an instruction to it."}, {"id": "docs_retraction_audit_not_in_volumes", "label": "NOT-IN-VOLUMES is not not-in-the-repo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/RETRACTION-AUDIT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The claim pass searched the nine live volumes only; several corrections' audit trails live in the governance tree deliberately outside them."}, {"id": "docs_retraction_audit_wrong_volume", "label": "An error caught in verification: right finding, wrong volume", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/RETRACTION-AUDIT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The volume column carries the adjudicator's attribution as given and is a pointer to check, not located evidence \u2014 except the four claim-pass rows, re-located by hand."}, {"id": "docs_retraction_audit_not_regenerable", "label": "The TSV is a record, not a regenerable artefact", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/RETRACTION-AUDIT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It was produced from